    "semantic_summary": "UnlitMaterial is a specialized class inheriting from ColorMaterial, designed for rendering surfaces without complex lighting calculations. It manages visual properties using a base color and an optional main texture, controlling texture mapping via uvScale and uvOffset. The component provides serialization methods to persist its state to JsonSerializedData and includes a destroy method to clean up associated GPU resources."
